---
import DocLayout from '../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<DocLayout
  title="Terms and conditions"
  description={`Terms for using the ${SITE.name} salary calculator. Results are estimates and not professional tax, legal or financial advice.`}
  updated="2026-09-13"
  legal
>
  <p>
    By using {SITE.name} ("the calculator", "this site") you agree to these terms. If you do not
    agree, please do not use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Estimates, not advice</h2>
  <p>
    The calculator produces <strong>estimates</strong> of take-home salary, income tax, provident
    fund, professional tax and related figures for {SITE.taxYearLabel}, based on the inputs you
    provide and on our reading of the law as described on the{' '}
    <a href="/how-it-works">How it works</a> page.
  </p>
  <p>
    It is not tax, legal, accounting or financial advice. Your actual salary depends on your
    employer's payroll policies, your full income and deductions, and rules that can change during
    the year. Always confirm figures with your employer's payroll team or a qualified professional
    such as a chartered accountant before making decisions, including accepting a job offer or
    choosing a tax regime.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    We check statutory rates against official sources and show the date they were last verified.
    Even so, we cannot guarantee that every figure is complete, current or correct for your
    situation. Some items, such as professional tax in states we have not verified, are shown as
    unverified or left for you to enter.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    The site is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, whether express
    or implied, including fitness for a particular purpose and accuracy.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} and its operators are not liable for any
    loss or damage arising from your use of, or reliance on, the site or its results, including
    financial loss, tax liability, interest or penalties.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>
    You may use the calculator for personal and professional purposes. You may not attempt to
    disrupt the site, scrape it at a volume that degrades service, or present its results as
    official figures from a government body or employer.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party links</h2>
  <p>
    The site links to government and other external websites for reference. We are not responsible
    for their content or availability.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms. Continued use of the site after changes are posted means you accept
    the revised terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>
  </p>
</DocLayout>
